stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> RUNNING: start (idempotency key, business key)
  RUNNING --> RUNNING: token advances; waits on user, async or timer step; incident opened or resolved
  RUNNING --> COMPLETED: last token reaches end
  RUNNING --> CANCELLED: cancel
  RUNNING --> COMPENSATING: retries exhausted with onFailure compensate, or throwCompensation
  COMPENSATING --> FAILED: all compensations done, or manual compensation incident resolved
  COMPLETED --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> [*]
  FAILED --> [*]
  note right of RUNNING
    Positions live in pre_token rows:
    ACTIVE, WAITING_USER, WAITING_ASYNC,
    WAITING_TIMER, JOINED, COMPLETED.
    An incident pauses one token, not the instance.
  end note
